'''Tapu Koko''' (Japanese: '''カプ・コケコ''' ''Kapu-Kokeko'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

